Embed project-scoped writes (upstream issue CaviraOSS/LongMemory#216, fix in PR #217).

applyImportPlan never called the embedder, so project ingest, remember_decision and
connector imports stored every memory with a null semantic vector. Delete this file, and
the apply step in the Dockerfile, once LM_COMMIT includes the upstream fix.

